{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">That's right. I sensed a strange presence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The presence of someone who isn't here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Some great will at work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone is pulling the strings, and we are nothing but their puppets.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For the first time, I sensed the presence of that </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="くぐつし">puppeteer</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
